              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko nalolite, nipo najiweni nyanga jili mguluka mwinani, ni nacipikene cili mkulila mwakwesya cicitiji kuti, “Likungu! Likungu! Likungu kwa ŵandu wosope ŵakutama pa cilambo capasi, malayika gatatu gala pitagambe kugomba malipenga gawo.”",
